%% VeriFace AI — end-to-end inference flow (app.py -> inference.py -> face_utils.py -> model.py)
%% Thresholds and temperature: research_runs/stage1_20261016/reports/app_policy.json (fitted on validation only).
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant App as app.py (Streamlit UI)
    participant Inf as inference.py
    participant Face as face_utils.crop_face_square
    participant Net as EfficientNet-B0 classifier
    participant CAM as Grad-CAM (app.py)

    Note over App,Inf: On first load: load_checkpoint(best_face_model.pth)<br/>refuses missing file, bare state_dict, wrong backbone, positive_class != FAKE

    User->>App: Upload JPG / JPEG / PNG
    App->>App: PIL open, convert to RGB (unreadable file -> error, no analysis)
    App->>Inf: preprocess(image)
    Inf->>Face: Haar cascade on a <=512 px copy (min face 40 px)
    alt no face detected
        Face-->>App: face_detected = False
        App-->>User: CANNOT VERIFY — NO FACE (Run button disabled)
    else face detected
        Face-->>Inf: square crop, 1.8x detector box, resized to 256 x 256
        Inf->>Inf: CenterCrop 224, ToTensor, ImageNet normalisation
        User->>App: Run Authenticity Audit
        App->>CAM: forward + backward on the logit
        CAM->>Net: hooks on the last Conv2d layer
        Net-->>CAM: logit (FAKE = 1) and 7 x 7 activation map
        CAM-->>App: logit, normalised heatmap
        App->>Inf: decide(sigmoid(logit)), calibrated_score(logit)
        Note right of Inf: raw < 0.30 -> LIKELY AUTHENTIC<br/>0.30 <= raw < 0.90 -> INCONCLUSIVE<br/>raw >= 0.90 -> LIKELY MANIPULATED<br/>display = sigmoid(logit / 1.5523)
        App-->>User: verdict, calibrated %, uncalibrated %, logit, meter, caveats
        App-->>User: optional Grad-CAM overlay on the 224 px model input
    end
